        '["Trim any fat from steak and dice.","In a large non-stick skillet or wok, heat vegetable oil and sesame oil.","Stir-fry meat over high heat for 1 minute.","Stir in low-sodium soy sauce.","Remove meat with a slotted spoon and keep warm.","Add celery (thinly sliced diagonally), onions (sliced) and chicken broth to the skillet.","Bring to a boil, reduce heat and cook for 5 minutes.","Add bean sprouts (rinsed).","Cook 3 minutes more, then return meat and stir to heat.","Serve with Confitti Rice and Sesame Spinach Salad."]',
